{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "core",
 "version": "1.1",
 "title": "core",
 "description": "The boot copier and the hook bus for the Digitakt II: every other mod needs it. From 1.1 also each frame's per-track parameter values before the stock modulators (ev_frame_params), the key-LED frame before the stock views (ev_key_leds), the mods' project data and kit data, saved and loaded with the project and its kits and copied with the kits (core_projdata, core_kitdata), and value rows for PERSONALIZE and SETTINGS (core_addvalue). On its own it changes nothing the unit does. Modwerk's Digitone II copy (OS 1.12): no .fast area, since SRAM is not qualified there, so no fast.s, core_fast or its copier.",
 "category": "Framework",
 "author": "irpina",
 "license": "GPL-2.0-or-later",
 "target": {
  "device": "digitone-mk2",
  "product": "Digitone II",
  "os": "1.12",
  "syx_sha256": "7e5b8a733d4ab1fdf7e5d22757f7d8eddaa3cbf71d0858874a791844c02ceb35",
  "section3_sha256": "a098f620019b2ad38fd7e0397df39501fb1cf6bc26d0283915f34c49446fdf1a",
  "section3_len": 3196288
 },
